msgid "characteristicsPanel/specialInfo/boss"
msgstr ""
"[Alpha and Omega] The Blitzträger boasts impressive armament and "
"teleportation technology, and is almost indestructible when its shield is "
"up. It also serves as a powerful platform for accessing a devastating weapon"
" system: Hyperion."

msgid "characteristicsPanel/specialInfo/hunter_1"
msgstr ""
"[Brawler] A good generalist at close range.\n"
"The vehicle can cause high damage to groups of Sentinels and repair itself between skirmishes."

msgid "characteristicsPanel/specialInfo/hunter_2"
msgstr ""
"[Juggernaut] A good assault vehicle against Sentinels.\n"
"It can cause serious burst damage to the Blitzträger or Sentinels and has thick armor, but needs to plan how to engage enemies."

msgid "characteristicsPanel/specialInfo/hunter_3"
msgstr ""
"[Hit and Run] A fast agitator to outmaneuver the Blitzträger.\n"
"The vehicle lacks power against Sentinels but compensates with hit-and-run tactics using speed and a temporary shield against the slow Blitzträger."

msgid "characteristicsPanel/specialInfo/hunter_4"
msgstr ""
"[Sniping Support] A guardian angel at medium to long range.\n"
"The vehicle can cause massive amounts of damage to targets from afar, but lacks the means to engage them close up."

